  dct:description "Ingested 18 source files into 24 assets under https://www.insperity.com/, with IRIs, labels and metadata brought into line with Semantic Governance: Services, Architecture & Integration v1.8 (Draft), Part III. Every asset is at version 0.1.0, Draft. Results: Application business taxonomy taxonomy (646 terms, 651 conformance errors, 3 warnings); Application business taxonomy shapes (35 terms, 0 conformance errors, 35 warnings); Application data domain taxonomy (223 terms, 223 conformance errors, 1 warning); Core party taxonomy (44 terms, 45 conformance errors, 1 warning); Core party shapes (7 terms, 0 conformance errors, 0 warnings); Core businessoperations taxonomy (76 terms, 77 conformance errors, 1 warning); Core compliance taxonomy (115 terms, 93 conformance errors, 11 warnings); Core compliance shapes (2 terms, 0 conformance errors, 0 warnings); Reference domain taxonomy (23 terms, 23 conformance errors, 1 warning); Reference domain shapes (20 terms, 0 conformance errors, 0 warnings); Core issue taxonomy (9 terms, 0 conformance errors, 1 warning); Core lifecycle taxonomy (21 terms, 21 conformance errors, 1 warning); Core location taxonomy (22 terms, 22 conformance errors, 1 warning); Core persona taxonomy (46 terms, 46 conformance errors, 1 warning); Core process taxonomy (12 terms, 12 conformance errors, 1 warning); Core process shapes (8 terms, 0 conformance errors, 0 warnings); Core product taxonomy (69 terms, 67 conformance errors, 1 warning); Core product shapes (12 terms, 0 conformance errors, 0 warnings); Core role taxonomy (5 terms, 5 conformance errors, 1 warning); Core rules taxonomy (16 terms, 16 conformance errors, 1 warning); Core services taxonomy (98 terms, 96 conformance errors, 1 warning); Core services technicalservices taxonomy (390 terms, 208 conformance errors, 1 warning); Core time taxonomy (25 terms, 25 conformance errors, 1 warning); Core taxonomy (51 terms, 51 conformance errors, 0 warnings). 21 files were skipped: Taxonomy_Core_Party_1.0.ttl, taxonomy-core-capability.ttl, taxonomy-core-decision.ttl, taxonomy-core-event.ttl, taxonomy-core-governance.ttl, taxonomy-core-issue.ttl, taxonomy-core-lifecycle.ttl, taxonomy-core-location.ttl, taxonomy-core-logic.ttl, taxonomy-core-measure.ttl, taxonomy-core-party.ttl, taxonomy-core-persona.ttl, taxonomy-core-policy.ttl, taxonomy-core-process.ttl, taxonomy-core-product.ttl, taxonomy-core-requirement.ttl, taxonomy-core-role.ttl, taxonomy-core-rule.ttl, taxonomy-core-service.ttl, taxonomy-core-time.ttl, taxonomy-core-value.ttl."@en ;
